'''Prince Yamato''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and can be unlocked by clearing any stage in [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event#Spirit War|Spirit War]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. His [[True Form]] was given in the same update in which it improves health and damage stats.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 473
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Prince Yamato
|name2 = Holy Yamato
|name3 = Rampaging Yamato
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Holy Yamato''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Rampaging Yamato''' when obtained from the [[Yamato Awakens!]] (may be dropped on the first stage but guaranteed on the second stage) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Yamato is a rusher that has the ability to do a decent amount of damage and thanks to his decent range he is able get off attacks while at a relatively safe distance and easy to connect with his target. Since most of his attack animation is backswing, he is able to rebound off attacks and get another hit off. However, his low health and knockback count work against him, meaning that if he doesn't outrange them he may only get one or two hits off before he dies.

{{Job|Classification = Rusher}}

